   ],
   "notes": [
    "10 AWG green from the arrester's ground lug down the left wall to the earth stud. The plate is plastic, so nothing else is earthed.",
    "Don't bond bar 2 to the earth stud: it would make a ground loop through the antenna shield."
   ]
  },
